WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.089 --> 00:00:07.260
I believe that I would be irresponsible at
this point if I didn't come to you and say

00:00:07.260 --> 00:00:10.140
there is an unfortunate reality.

00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:16.850
There is an undeniable reality that if all
else is equal, if you can do it safely, we're

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:23.400
probably better off if you vote in person
in November or hand deliver, deliver your

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:24.830
ballot and track it.

00:00:24.830 --> 00:00:28.750
If that is, if voting in person is not a realistic
or safe possibility.

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:32.279
Now, I don't want to encourage anybody to
do anything dangerous.

00:00:32.279 --> 00:00:37.370
And of course, voting in person, there can
be funny business and voting by mail.

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:38.730
There can be funny business.

00:00:38.730 --> 00:00:46.020
But my sense right now is that your vote is
more likely to be counted and counted correctly

00:00:46.020 --> 00:00:48.000
if you vote in person.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:53.710
And we now have an additional reason to suspect
that it is important to consider voting in

00:00:53.710 --> 00:00:59.160
person if you can do it safely, of course,
which is that more and more data firms are

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:05.139
predicting that we could have an extremely
chaotic situation where because we know that

00:01:05.139 --> 00:01:10.270
those planning to vote in person are more
likely to vote Trump and those planning to

00:01:10.270 --> 00:01:13.479
vote absentee are more likely to vote Joe
Biden.

00:01:13.479 --> 00:01:18.109
There is a very good possibility based on
analysis by a number of political data strategy

00:01:18.109 --> 00:01:26.399
firms, including hawk fish, that we may well
have a situation where Trump is slightly ahead

00:01:26.399 --> 00:01:30.929
on election night and will almost certainly
claim victory.

00:01:30.929 --> 00:01:38.999
But as the Biden absentee votes come in, in
the set 24, 48, 72, 96 hours after Election

00:01:38.999 --> 00:01:41.459
Day, Joe Biden may well win.

00:01:41.459 --> 00:01:43.989
Now, we don't know that that's going to happen.

00:01:43.989 --> 00:01:50.539
Biden might win outright on election night
and grow the lead as mail and votes are counted.

00:01:50.539 --> 00:01:56.539
Trump may win outright on election night by
a lot, and then the margin might shrink as

00:01:56.539 --> 00:01:59.359
absentee ballots are counted and Trump will
still win.

00:01:59.359 --> 00:02:01.069
That's a possibility.

00:02:01.069 --> 00:02:07.279
But Hawk Fish is now saying and they have
an upcoming interview on Axios on HBO, which

00:02:07.279 --> 00:02:09.179
will see, I believe, over the weekend.

00:02:09.179 --> 00:02:15.750
The CEO of Hawk Fish, Josh Mendelson, says
there is a scenario they are projecting called

00:02:15.750 --> 00:02:17.150
the Red Mirage.

00:02:17.150 --> 00:02:24.680
And the Red Mirage is the idea of a red victory
on Election Day, which will merely be a mirage

00:02:24.680 --> 00:02:25.870
which will evaporate.

00:02:25.870 --> 00:02:26.870
Right.

00:02:26.870 --> 00:02:33.540
Continuing this mirage metaphore as we approach
100 percent counting of ballots, including

00:02:33.540 --> 00:02:38.709
absentee ballots, at which point it may actually
be Joe Biden who has won.

00:02:38.709 --> 00:02:41.290
And it looks like it could take five, five
or so days.

00:02:41.290 --> 00:02:44.800
Trump is talking about we might not know the
results for months.

00:02:44.800 --> 00:02:45.939
Trump said we might not know the results.

00:02:45.939 --> 00:02:49.610
For years, Trump even said we might have to
redo the election.

00:02:49.610 --> 00:02:51.150
No, that's not true.

00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:56.140
But it could be five days, five business days
even, which is really like a week.

00:02:56.140 --> 00:02:58.819
So this is.

00:02:58.819 --> 00:03:03.049
Scenario that will most fuel Trump claiming
it's rigged.

00:03:03.049 --> 00:03:08.290
If Trump is ahead on election night and really
does fall behind after all the absentee ballots

00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:11.290
are counted, Trump will claim that it is rigged.

00:03:11.290 --> 00:03:16.540
And in fact, in the intervening period between
Trump claiming victory on election night,

00:03:16.540 --> 00:03:20.900
as those ballots are being counted, you are
likely to see two things, neither of which

00:03:20.900 --> 00:03:22.319
is particularly good.

00:03:22.319 --> 00:03:26.900
Number one, you are likely to see a wave of
lawsuits at the precinct level, at the at

00:03:26.900 --> 00:03:31.069
the county level, at the state level, from
the Trump campaign, trying to stop the counting

00:03:31.069 --> 00:03:32.700
of absentee ballots.

00:03:32.700 --> 00:03:38.379
It may not work and you won't see it everywhere,
but it is almost a certainty that if Trump

00:03:38.379 --> 00:03:45.010
narrowly wins on election night, I should
better say is ahead on election night electorally

00:03:45.010 --> 00:03:50.510
because of small margins in a bunch of states,
which is very plausible that Trump will do

00:03:50.510 --> 00:03:55.810
everything he can to stop the counting of
absentee ballots using all sorts of different

00:03:55.810 --> 00:03:58.310
arguments, which we will talk about on a different
day.

00:03:58.310 --> 00:04:01.780
And of course, those may ultimately be decisions
made by Trump appointed judges.

00:04:01.780 --> 00:04:06.950
That's one thing that will happen if the Red
Mirage scenario is a reality.

00:04:06.950 --> 00:04:12.260
The second thing that will happen is Trump
will claim victory and will say they're trying

00:04:12.260 --> 00:04:15.700
to take it from me with phony absentee ballots.

00:04:15.700 --> 00:04:20.669
And it is very plausible that this will lead
to violence in the streets from the Trump

00:04:20.669 --> 00:04:21.669
gun people.

00:04:21.669 --> 00:04:25.410
Now, I don't want to spend too much time on
that because we've discussed it before.

00:04:25.410 --> 00:04:28.300
But this gets me to.

00:04:28.300 --> 00:04:32.550
The position that I would say I want to choose
my words carefully.

00:04:32.550 --> 00:04:38.360
I believe that all else being equal, if you
can do it safely, it's ideal to vote in person

00:04:38.360 --> 00:04:41.370
and even vote early in person if you can.

00:04:41.370 --> 00:04:43.610
A lot of states have early voting.

00:04:43.610 --> 00:04:47.270
That would be the number one way vote early
and in-person.

00:04:47.270 --> 00:04:49.240
Fewer people usually voting early.

00:04:49.240 --> 00:04:50.770
Shorter lines.

00:04:50.770 --> 00:04:53.680
Then it would be vote in person on November
3rd if it's safe.

00:04:53.680 --> 00:04:57.240
If you're not high risk, I understand not
wanting to do that because of the risk of

00:04:57.240 --> 00:04:58.729
coronavirus.

00:04:58.729 --> 00:05:00.340
Then it would be Maylin.

00:05:00.340 --> 00:05:04.650
But you did you hand deliver the ballot to
a ballot box?

00:05:04.650 --> 00:05:07.300
And then fourth would be you just mail it
in.

00:05:07.300 --> 00:05:13.650
And we hope USPS lawsuits don't stop the counting,
whatever, no matter what vote.

00:05:13.650 --> 00:05:17.060
But this is how I would sort of rank the efficacy
of those voting options.

00:05:17.060 --> 00:05:19.800
A lot of what's going on, we just can't control.

00:05:19.800 --> 00:05:23.120
We're activating around, stopping destruction
of the post office.

00:05:23.120 --> 00:05:27.500
The damage may have already been done by Lewis
Dejoy, but ultimately we can't really control

00:05:27.500 --> 00:05:28.500
it.

00:05:28.500 --> 00:05:30.300
We can't control voter intimidation.

00:05:30.300 --> 00:05:32.070
We can't control voter purges.

00:05:32.070 --> 00:05:33.389
We can't control foreign meddling.

00:05:33.389 --> 00:05:36.110
We can't control hacking of machines individually.

00:05:36.110 --> 00:05:40.240
I mean, obviously, we can be activists to
shine a spotlight on these problems.

00:05:40.240 --> 00:05:43.889
We can decide how we choose to vote.

00:05:43.889 --> 00:05:49.360
And I am leaning towards some kind of in-person
voting, ideally early, if not on November

00:05:49.360 --> 00:05:54.639
3rd is probably the best way to both increase
the likelihood our vote is counted correctly

00:05:54.639 --> 00:05:59.300
and decrease the probability of this Red Mirage
scenario.

00:05:59.300 --> 00:06:01.280
Let me know what you think.

